{"id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#thm:energy-estimates","title":"thm:energy-estimates","path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6.md","line":119,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6.tex#thm:energy-estimates","uses":["[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#def:bilinear-form-weak-solution-l2]]","[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#def:uniform-ellipticity]]","[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter5#thm:poincare-w01p-subcritical]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6.tex","label":"thm:energy-estimates","line":159,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Energy estimates]\n\\label{thm:energy-estimates}\n\\uses{def:bilinear-form-weak-solution-l2, def:uniform-ellipticity, thm:poincare-w01p-subcritical}\n\\dcref{ch6:6.2-thm-2}\n\\group{Weak Solutions}\n\nThere exist constants $\\alpha,\\beta > 0$ and $\\gamma \\geq 0$ such that\n$$(i) \\qquad |B[u,v]| \\leq \\alpha\\|u\\|_{H_0^1(U)}\\|v\\|_{H_0^1(U)}$$\nand\n$$(ii) \\qquad \\beta\\|u\\|_{H_0^1(U)}^2 \\leq B[u,u] + \\gamma\\|u\\|_{L^2(U)}^2$$\nfor all $u,v \\in H_0^1(U)$.\n\\end{theorem}\n\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch Boundedness of the coefficients and Cauchy--Schwarz prove (i). Ellipticity controls $\\|Du\\|_{L^2}^2$; absorbing the first-order term with Cauchy inequality and using Poincare inequality yields (ii).\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Energy estimates] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a656e657267792d657374696d61746573\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter6%23def%3Abilinear-form-weak-solution-l2\">↗ def:bilinear-form-weak-solution-l2</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter6%23def%3Auniform-ellipticity\">↗ def:uniform-ellipticity</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter5%23thm%3Apoincare-w01p-subcritical\">↗ thm:poincare-w01p-subcritical</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch6:6.2-thm-2</span></span>\\group Weak Solutions <p></p>There exist constants <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\alpha ,\\beta &gt; 0$\">$\\alpha ,\\beta &gt; 0$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\gamma \\geq 0$\">$\\gamma \\geq 0$</span> such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ (i) \\qquad |B[u,v]| \\leq \\alpha \\| u\\| _{H_0^1(U)}\\| v\\| _{H_0^1(U)} \\]\">\\[ (i) \\qquad |B[u,v]| \\leq \\alpha \\| u\\| _{H_0^1(U)}\\| v\\| _{H_0^1(U)} \\]</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ (ii) \\qquad \\beta \\| u\\| _{H_0^1(U)}^2 \\leq B[u,u] + \\gamma \\| u\\| _{L^2(U)}^2 \\]\">\\[ (ii) \\qquad \\beta \\| u\\| _{H_0^1(U)}^2 \\leq B[u,u] + \\gamma \\| u\\| _{L^2(U)}^2 \\]</span> for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u,v \\in H_0^1(U)$\">$u,v \\in H_0^1(U)$</span>.  <p></p><section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Boundedness of the coefficients and Cauchy–Schwarz prove (i). Ellipticity controls <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\| Du\\| _{L^2}^2$\">$\\| Du\\| _{L^2}^2$</span>; absorbing the first-order term with Cauchy inequality and using Poincare inequality yields (ii). </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group、sketch"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#rem:lax-milgram-symmetric-case","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter6#